{"id":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"The Hidden Words — Arabic 1 (Pure Heart)"}],"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:bahai:hidden-words","sequence":1,"unit":"aphorism"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1:ar","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1","language":"ar","script":"Arab","representation":"source","text":"يَا ابْنَ الرُّوحِ! فِي أَوَّلِ الْقَوْلِ امْلِكْ قَلْباً جَيِّداً حَسَناً مُنِيراً، لِتَمْلِكَ مُلْكاً دَائِماً قَدِيماً بَاقِياً أَزَلاً."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1:en","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1","language":"en","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"O Son of Spirit! My first counsel is this: Possess a pure, kindly and radiant heart, that thine may be a sovereignty ancient, imperishable and everlasting."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1:id","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_1","language":"id","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Wahai Putra Roh! Nasihat-Ku yang pertama adalah ini: Milikilah kalbu yang murni, penuh kasih dan bercahaya, agar menjadi milikmu kerajaan yang abadi, kekal dan tiada berkesudahan."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"The Hidden Words — Arabic 2 (Justice)"}],"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:bahai:hidden-words","sequence":2,"unit":"aphorism"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2:ar","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2","language":"ar","script":"Arab","representation":"source","text":"يَا ابْنَ الرُّوحِ! أَحَبُّ الأَشْيَاءِ عِنْدِي الْإِنْصَافُ، لَا تَرْغَبْ عَنْهُ إِنْ تَكُنْ إِلَيَّ رَاغِباً، وَلَا تَغْفُلْ مِنْهُ لِتَكُونَ لِي أَمِيناً، وَأَنْتَ تُوَفَّقُ بِذَلِكَ أَنْ تُشَاهِدَ الأَشْيَاءَ بِعَيْنِكَ لَا بِعَيْنِ الْعِبَادِ."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2:en","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2","language":"en","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"O Son of Spirit! The best beloved of all things in My sight is Justice; turn not away therefrom if thou desirest Me, and neglect it not that I may confide in thee. By its aid thou shalt see with thine own eyes and not through the eyes of others."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2:id","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_2","language":"id","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Wahai Putra Roh! Hal yang paling Kucintai di antara segala sesuatu adalah Keadilan; janganlah berpaling darinya jika engkau mendambakan Daku, dan janganlah mengabaikannya agar Aku dapat mempercayaimu. Dengan pertolongannya engkau akan menyaksikan segala sesuatu dengan matamu sendiri dan bukan dengan mata orang lain."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"The Hidden Words — Arabic 3 (Love and Creation)"}],"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:bahai:hidden-words","sequence":3,"unit":"aphorism"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3:ar","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3","language":"ar","script":"Arab","representation":"source","text":"يَا ابْنَ الإِنْسَانِ! أَحْبَبْتُ خَلْقَكَ فَخَلَقْتُكَ، فَأَحْبِبْنِي كَيْ أَذْكُرَكَ وَفِي رُوحِ الْحَيَاةِ أُثَبِّتَكَ."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3:en","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3","language":"en","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"O Son of Man! Veiled in My immemorial being and in the ancient eternity of My essence, I knew My love for thee; therefore I created thee, have engraved on thee Mine image and revealed to thee My beauty."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3:id","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:bahai:hidden-words:arabic_3","language":"id","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Wahai Putra Manusia! Tersembunyi dalam keberadaan-Ku yang abadi dan dalam keabadian zat-Ku, Aku mencintaimu; oleh karena itu Aku menciptakanmu, telah memahat citra-Ku padamu dan menyingkapkan keindahan-Ku kepadamu."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:bahai:hidden-words-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:bahai:hidden-words:rec-2026"}}}
